  "title": "NTPC and EoI Inviting Partners to Invest in Cogeneration Projects",
  "summary": "NTPC has invited Expressions of Interest (EOI) from commercial and industrial (C&I) entities to invest 26% equity in co-generation projects, aiming to meet industrial energy requirements through integrated power supply solutions. The initiative seeks to enhance energy efficiency, sustainability, and cost optimisation.",
